      "key": "SFCC-156",
      "summary": "Account Registration — Duplicate Account Prevention & Apple Hide My Email",
      "description": "As a Shopper,\nI want the system to prevent duplicate accounts being created for my email address, including when I use Apple's Hide My Email feature,\nso that my order history, wishlist, and account details remain consolidated under a single account regardless of how I registered.\nThis story addresses two related scenarios raised in refinement: \n(1) general duplicate account prevention at registration and email change, \n(2) the Apple Hide My Email relay address scenario, where a customer registers with a private Apple relay address that does not match their real email, creating a duplicate account risk. This story is a dependency for SFCC-135 (Social Login via Apple ID).",
