      "customfield_10231": {
        "value": {
          "type": "doc",
          "version": 1,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "orderedList",
              "attrs": {
                "order": 1,
                "localId": "d44b2dd3264c"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "ae9093be042c"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given a shopper is on a PDP, when the page loads, then the Find My Size CTA is displayed next to the size selector when Measmerize is configured for that product."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "2d5081707090"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "812d08bb8144"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given a shopper is on a PDP where Measmerize is configured for the product, when the shopper clicks Find My Size, then the Measmerize widget opens."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "f160e410821d"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "cd087e5663b8"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given a shopper is on a PDP where Measmerize is not configured for the product, then Find My Size does not appear and the shopper can navigate to the Size & Fit guide instead (if "
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "inlineCard",
                          "attrs": {
                            "url": "https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-102",
                            "localId": "aa6879b8d4e7"
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": " is not built, then it should just not return any result)."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "e6f4d9a9b69b"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "cff010caf355"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given the Measmerize widget has generated a size recommendation for the shopper, when the shopper views the recommended size in the widget and clicks on “Continue”, then the size selector on the PDP is updated with the recommended size. "
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "c86d48b241d5"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "b1de1e9bf799"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given the Measmerize widget has generated a size recommendation for the shopper, when the shopper views the size selector, then the Find your size CTA has been replaced by the word “Recommended: <<size>>*”, so for size 0P that would be “Recommended: 0P*” (Managed by Measmerize, if not yet built, we would have to test this AC at a later stage)"
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "6d2993051e82"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "de14d8366945"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given the Measmerize widget has generated a size recommendation for the shopper, when the shopper views the sizes in the size selector and selects another size than the recommended size, then the Measmerize recommendation remains in the same place as specified in AC5. "
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "6a36947b15bd"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "bc0cd4db8c71"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given the shopper has used Measmerize and navigates to another product’s PDP, when the shopper views the size selector, then the size is "
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "not",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "strong"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": " prepopulated in the size selector, but the Measmerize recommendation remains in the same place as specified in AC5. "
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "6e1a1e060604"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "298b858ef4fe"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
