      "summary": "Search – Search Redirect Rules Configuration",
      "description": "As a\n Site Merchandiser, \nI want\n the search redirect rules from the current Athos/Magento search indexes migrated into the SFCC search configuration, \nso that \nshoppers who search for boutique names, collections, or events continue to be redirected to the correct destination pages.\nThis story depends on SFCC-103 (Search Index & Attribute Configuration Foundation) being complete before configuration can be tested.\nUnlike synonyms and query replacements, redirect rules cannot be migrated as-is — the destination URLs are currently pointing at Magento URLs and must be mapped to their SFCC equivalents before BM configuration can begin. The URL mapping exercise must be completed in the Confluence source data pages before this story moves to In Progress.\nSource data and URL mapping:\n \nSearch — Redirect Rules Source Data & URL Mapping - Adobe SFCC - Confluence\nRedirect rules by storefront:\nAthos Index\nStorefront\nRules\nau\nAU\n183\nus\nUS-Dom\n104\ncaen\nUS-Int\n89\nuk\nUK\n99\neu\nEU-Dom (EN)\n99\neufr\nEU-Dom (FR)\n114\neuit\nEU-Dom (IT)\n112\neues\nEU-Dom (ES)\n113\neuch\nEU-Int\n101\nhk\nHK\n95\naeen\nME\n97\nTotal\n1,206\nURL categories requiring mapping before configuration:\nCategory\nApproach\nBoutique store locator pages (~80%)\nBatch-mappable once SFCC store locator URL format is confirmed\nBoutique detail pages (~10%)\nBatch-mappable once SFCC boutique detail page URL format is confirmed\nCollection / event pages (~10%)\nIndividual review required — confirm each destination exists in SFCC or Contentful",
